import json
from pathlib import Path
root=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2]/'contracts/window-seven'
load=lambda p:json.loads((root/p).read_text())
summary=load('summary.json');packet=load('human-review-packet.json')
fields=load('field-inventory.json')['fields'];candidates=load('evidence/evidence-candidates.json')['candidates']
data={'summary':summary,'packet_hash':packet['packet_content_sha256'],'fields':[{'inventory':f,'evidence':[e for e in candidates if e['field_id']==f['field_id']]} for f in fields]}
html='''<!doctype html><html lang="ja"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>7商品 Selection Contract レビュー</title><style>body{font:16px system-ui;background:#f3f6f7;color:#18303c;margin:0}main{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:32px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #d4e0e5;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin:18px 0}p{line-height:1.7}input,select{font:inherit;padding:10px;margin-right:12px}summary{cursor:pointer;padding:14px 0}details{border-bottom:1px solid #dde4e7}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:12px;background:#f4f7f8;padding:14px}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}a{color:#176b62}.pending{color:#8a5c09}</style><main><h1>7商品 Selection Contract レビュー</h1><p class="pending">Human Decision 待ち — FORMAL昇格・Mergeは未実行</p><div class="card"><p>Evidence候補はAccepted済みではありません。各候補のScope・資料・Supporting Fact・Hashを確認し、承認／却下する対象を指定してください。AIはHuman Reviewerを代行しません。</p><p id="metrics"></p><p>Packet Content SHA256<br><code id="hash"></code></p><a href="human-review-packet.json">固定Packet</a> · <a href="field-inventory.json">全Field Inventory</a> · <a href="evidence/independent-verification.json">独立検証</a></div><div class="card"><label>商品 <select id="product"><option value="">全商品</option></select></label><label>検索 <input id="search" placeholder="Field / ラベル"></label><p id="count"></p><div id="list"></div></div><p>この画面に承認を送信する機能はありません。本人の明示判断後、Decisionを確定したHashへ結び付けます。Runtime / Product Master / 既存Canonical Mappingは変更していません。</p></main><script id="data" type="application/json">__DATA__</script><script>const d=JSON.parse(document.querySelector('#data').textContent),s=d.summary;document.querySelector('#metrics').textContent=`${s.total_field_count} Field / ${s.evidence_candidates} Evidence候補 / ${s.missing_claims} Missing Accepted Claims / Runtime Diff ${s.runtime_diff}`;document.querySelector('#hash').textContent=d.packet_hash;const p=document.querySelector('#product');for(const [id,n]of Object.entries(s.product_field_counts)){const f=d.fields.find(x=>x.inventory.product_id===id).inventory,o=document.createElement('option');o.value=id;o.textContent=`${f.manufacturer} ${f.product} (${n})`;p.append(o)}function render(){const q=document.querySelector('#search').value.toLowerCase(),rows=d.fields.filter(x=>(!p.value||x.inventory.product_id===p.value)&&JSON.stringify([x.inventory.field_id,x.inventory.ui_label]).toLowerCase().includes(q)),list=document.querySelector('#list');list.replaceChildren();document.querySelector('#count').textContent=`${rows.length} Field`;for(const x of rows){const f=x.inventory,box=document.createElement('details'),title=document.createElement('summary');title.textContent=`${f.manufacturer} ${f.product} | ${f.ui_label.join(' / ')} | ${f.internal_key} | ${f.mapping_type} | PROVISIONAL`;box.append(title);const pre=document.createElement('pre');pre.textContent=JSON.stringify({field_id:f.field_id,fact_kind:f.fact_kind,semantic_mapping:f.semantic_mapping,required_claims:f.required_claims,missing_claims:f.missing_claims,evidence_candidates:x.evidence},null,2);box.append(pre);list.append(box)}}p.onchange=render;document.querySelector('#search').oninput=render;render();</script></html>'''
(root/'review.html').write_text(html.replace('__DATA__',json.dumps(data,ensure_ascii=False).replace('</','<\\/')))
